## 2. Researcher Context

- **身份**：Buy-side equity researcher，hedge fund / long-short
- **覆盖**：industrials、aerospace & defense、advanced manufacturing、oil & gas、renewable、nuclear、emerging tech
- **目标**：判断投不投、怎么投、何时退

